{"s":64,"v":[{"t":"Whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth is exalting Allāh. To Him belongs dominion, and to Him belongs [all] praise, and He is over all things competent.","w":[["يُسَبِّحُ","Glorifies","yusabbiḥu",""],["لِلَّهِ","[to] Allah","lillahi","",[["لِ",8],["لَّهِ",9]]],["مَا","whatever","mā",""],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَمَا","and whatever","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلْأَرْضِ","the earth","l-arḍi","ۖ",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["لَهُ","For Him","lahu","",[["لَ",8],["هُ",5]]],["ٱلْمُلْكُ","(is the) dominion","l-mul'ku","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُلْكُ",259]]],["وَلَهُ","and for Him","walahu","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",8],["هُ",5]]],["ٱلْحَمْدُ","(is) the praise","l-ḥamdu","ۖ",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَمْدُ",282]]],["وَهُوَ","And He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["عَلَىٰ","(is) on","ʿalā",""],["كُلِّ","every","kulli",""],["شَىْءٍۢ","thing","shayin",""],["قَدِيرٌ","All-Powerful","qadīrun",""]]},{"t":"It is He who created you, and among you is the disbeliever, and among you is the believer. And Allāh, of what you do, is Seeing.","w":[["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["ٱلَّذِى","(is) the One Who","alladhī",""],["خَلَقَكُمْ","created you","khalaqakum","",[["خَلَقَ",76],["كُمْ",4]]],["فَمِنكُمْ","and among you","faminkum","",[["فَ",7],["مِن",6],["كُمْ",4]]],["كَافِرٌۭ","(is) a disbeliever","kāfirun",""],["وَمِنكُم","and among you","waminkum","",[["وَ",1],["مِن",6],["كُم",4]]],["مُّؤْمِنٌۭ","(is) a believer","mu'minun","ۚ"],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["بِمَا","of what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["تَعْمَلُونَ","you do","taʿmalūna","",[["تَعْمَلُ",58],["ونَ",4]]],["بَصِيرٌ","(is) All-Seer","baṣīrun",""]]},{"t":"He created the heavens and earth in truth and formed you and perfected your forms; and to Him is the [final] destination.","w":[["خَلَقَ","He created","khalaqa",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَٱلْأَرْضَ","and the earth","wal-arḍa","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضَ",35]]],["بِٱلْحَقِّ","with truth","bil-ḥaqi","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["حَقِّ",64]]],["وَصَوَّرَكُمْ","and He formed you","waṣawwarakum","",[["وَ",1],["صَوَّرَ",1563],["كُمْ",4]]],["فَأَحْسَنَ","and made good","fa-aḥsana","",[["فَ",7],["أَحْسَنَ",482]]],["صُوَرَكُمْ","your forms","ṣuwarakum","ۖ",[["صُوَرَ",1888],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَإِلَيْهِ","and to Him","wa-ilayhi","",[["وَ",1],["إِلَيْ",26],["هِ",5]]],["ٱلْمَصِيرُ","(is) the final return","l-maṣīru","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَصِيرُ",400]]]]},{"t":"He knows what is within the heavens and earth and knows what you conceal and what you declare. And Allāh is Knowing of that within the breasts.","w":[["يَعْلَمُ","He knows","yaʿlamu",""],["مَا","what","mā",""],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَٱلْأَرْضِ","and the earth","wal-arḍi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["وَيَعْلَمُ","and He knows","wayaʿlamu","",[["وَ",1],["يَعْلَمُ",40]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["تُسِرُّونَ","you conceal","tusirrūna","",[["تُسِرُّ",533],["ونَ",4]]],["وَمَا","and what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["تُعْلِنُونَ","you declare","tuʿ'linūna","ۚ",[["تُعْلِنُ",704],["ونَ",4]]],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["عَلِيمٌۢ","(is) All-Knowing","ʿalīmun",""],["بِذَاتِ","of what","bidhāti","",[["بِ",10],["ذَاتِ",87]]],["ٱلصُّدُورِ","(is in) the breasts","l-ṣudūri","",[["ٱل",2],["صُّدُورِ",275]]]]},{"t":"Has there not come to you the news of those who disbelieved before? So they tasted the bad consequence of their affair, and they will have a painful punishment.","w":[["أَلَمْ","Has not","alam","",[["أَ",31],["لَمْ",44]]],["يَأْتِكُمْ","come to you","yatikum","",[["يَأْتِ",62],["كُمْ",4]]],["نَبَؤُا۟","(the) news","naba-u",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(of) those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieved","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["مِن","from","min",""],["قَبْلُ","before","qablu",""],["فَذَاقُوا۟","So they tasted","fadhāqū","",[["فَ",7],["ذَاقُ",334],["وا۟",3]]],["وَبَالَ","(the bad) consequence","wabāla",""],["أَمْرِهِمْ","(of) their affair","amrihim","",[["أَمْرِ",82],["هِمْ",3]]],["وَلَهُمْ","and for them","walahum","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["عَذَابٌ","(is) a punishment","ʿadhābun",""],["أَلِيمٌۭ","painful","alīmun",""]]},{"t":"That is because their messengers used to come to them with clear evidences, but they said, \"Shall human beings guide us?\" and disbelieved and turned away. And Allāh dispensed [with them]; and Allāh is Free of need and Praiseworthy.","w":[["ذَٰلِكَ","That","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["بِأَنَّهُۥ","(is) because","bi-annahu","",[["بِ",10],["أَنَّ",41],["هُۥ",5]]],["كَانَت","had","kānat",""],["تَّأْتِيهِمْ","come to them","tatīhim","",[["تَّأْتِي",62],["هِمْ",3]]],["رُسُلُهُم","their Messengers","rusuluhum","",[["رُسُلُ",47],["هُم",3]]],["بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","with clear proofs","bil-bayināti","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["بَيِّنَـٰتِ",182]]],["فَقَالُوٓا۟","but they said","faqālū","",[["فَ",7],["قَالُ",16],["وٓا۟",3]]],["أَبَشَرٌۭ","Shall human beings","abasharun","",[["أَ",31],["بَشَرٌۭ",324]]],["يَهْدُونَنَا","guide us","yahdūnanā","",[["يَهْدُ",96],["ونَ",3],["نَا",11]]],["فَكَفَرُوا۟","So they disbelieved","fakafarū","",[["فَ",7],["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["وَتَوَلَّوا۟","and turned away","watawallaw","ۚ",[["وَ",1],["تَوَلَّ",159],["وا۟",3]]],["وَّٱسْتَغْنَى","And can do without them","wa-is'taghnā","",[["وَّ",1],["ٱسْتَغْنَى",1481]]],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu","ۚ"],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["غَنِىٌّ","(is) Self-sufficient","ghaniyyun",""],["حَمِيدٌۭ","Praiseworthy","ḥamīdun",""]]},{"t":"Those who disbelieve have claimed that they will never be resurrected. Say, \"Yes, by my Lord, you will surely be resurrected; then you will surely be informed of what you did. And that, for Allāh, is easy.\"","w":[["زَعَمَ","Claim","zaʿama",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوٓا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وٓا۟",3]]],["أَن","that","an",""],["لَّن","never","lan",""],["يُبْعَثُوا۟","will they be raised","yub'ʿathū","ۚ",[["يُبْعَثُ",235],["وا۟",3]]],["قُلْ","Say","qul",""],["بَلَىٰ","Yes","balā",""],["وَرَبِّى","by my Lord","warabbī","",[["وَ",1],["رَبِّ",24],["ى",20]]],["لَتُبْعَثُنَّ","surely you will be raised","latub'ʿathunna","",[["لَ",23],["تُبْعَثُ",235],["نَّ",0]]],["ثُمَّ","then","thumma",""],["لَتُنَبَّؤُنَّ","surely you will be informed","latunabba-unna","",[["لَ",23],["تُنَبَّؤُ",265],["نَّ",0]]],["بِمَا","of what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["عَمِلْتُمْ","you did","ʿamil'tum","ۚ",[["عَمِلْ",58],["تُمْ",4]]],["وَذَٰلِكَ","And that","wadhālika","",[["وَ",1],["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["عَلَى","for","ʿalā",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["يَسِيرٌۭ","(is) easy","yasīrun",""]]},{"t":"So believe in Allāh and His Messenger and the light [i.e., the Qur’ān] which We have sent down. And Allāh is Aware of what you do.","w":[["فَـَٔامِنُوا۟","So believe","faāminū","",[["فَ",7],["ـَٔامِنُ",30],["وا۟",4]]],["بِٱللَّهِ","in Allah","bil-lahi","",[["بِ",10],["ٱللَّهِ",9]]],["وَرَسُولِهِۦ","and His Messenger","warasūlihi","",[["وَ",1],["رَسُولِ",47],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَٱلنُّورِ","and the Light","wal-nūri","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["نُّورِ",284]]],["ٱلَّذِىٓ","which","alladhī",""],["أَنزَلْنَا","We have sent down","anzalnā","ۚ",[["أَنزَلْ",77],["نَا",11]]],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["بِمَا","of what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["تَعْمَلُونَ","you do","taʿmalūna","",[["تَعْمَلُ",58],["ونَ",4]]],["خَبِيرٌۭ","(is) All-Aware","khabīrun",""]]},{"t":"The Day He will assemble you for the Day of Assembly - that is the Day of Deprivation. And whoever believes in Allāh and does righteousness - He will remove from him his misdeeds and admit him to gardens beneath which rivers flow, wherein they will abide forever. That is the great attainment.","w":[["يَوْمَ","(The) Day","yawma",""],["يَجْمَعُكُمْ","He will assemble you","yajmaʿukum","",[["يَجْمَعُ",468],["كُمْ",4]]],["لِيَوْمِ","for (the) Day","liyawmi","",[["لِ",8],["يَوْمِ",33]]],["ٱلْجَمْعِ","(of) the Assembly","l-jamʿi","ۖ",[["ٱلْ",2],["جَمْعِ",676]]],["ذَٰلِكَ","that","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["يَوْمُ","(will be the) Day","yawmu",""],["ٱلتَّغَابُنِ","(of) mutual loss and gain","l-taghābuni","ۗ",[["ٱل",2],["تَّغَابُنِ",3210]]],["وَمَن","And whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَن",25]]],["يُؤْمِنۢ","believes","yu'min",""],["بِٱللَّهِ","in Allah","bil-lahi","",[["بِ",10],["ٱللَّهِ",9]]],["وَيَعْمَلْ","and does","wayaʿmal","",[["وَ",1],["يَعْمَلْ",58]]],["صَـٰلِحًۭا","righteous deeds","ṣāliḥan",""],["يُكَفِّرْ","He will remove","yukaffir",""],["عَنْهُ","from him","ʿanhu","",[["عَنْ",34],["هُ",5]]],["سَيِّـَٔاتِهِۦ","his evil deeds","sayyiātihi","",[["سَيِّـَٔاتِ",211],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَيُدْخِلْهُ","and He will admit him","wayud'khil'hu","",[["وَ",1],["يُدْخِلْ",285],["هُ",5]]],["جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","(to) Gardens","jannātin",""],["تَجْرِى","flow","tajrī",""],["مِن","from","min",""],["تَحْتِهَا","underneath it","taḥtihā","",[["تَحْتِ",241],["هَا",22]]],["ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","the rivers","l-anhāru","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَنْهَـٰرُ",230]]],["خَـٰلِدِينَ","abiding","khālidīna",""],["فِيهَآ","therein","fīhā","",[["فِي",14],["هَآ",22]]],["أَبَدًۭا","forever","abadan","ۚ"],["ذَٰلِكَ","That","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["ٱلْفَوْزُ","(is) the success","l-fawzu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["فَوْزُ",526]]],["ٱلْعَظِيمُ","the great","l-ʿaẓīmu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَظِيمُ",124]]]]},{"t":"But the ones who disbelieved and denied Our verses - those are the companions of the Fire, abiding eternally therein; and wretched is the destination.","w":[["وَٱلَّذِينَ","But those who","wa-alladhīna","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّذِينَ",17]]],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieved","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["وَكَذَّبُوا۟","and denied","wakadhabū","",[["وَ",1],["كَذّ